{"id":"n60624-1-8","stage":1,"title":"다섯째 · 第五","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n60624-1-8-1","ko":"할머니께서는 딸만 다섯 명이라면서요?","zh":"听说您有五个孩子，全是女儿？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"할머니께서는","meaning":"奶奶，姥姥","explanation":"할머니：奶奶，姥姥；께서：이/가 的敬语形式，标记受到尊敬的主语。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"할머니","audio":"/audio/8dc4d6918deb0b6e1d10.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27375","senseId":"1","lemma":"할머니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"딸만","meaning":"女儿","explanation":"딸：女儿；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"딸","audio":"/audio/11cf51a3ca8b5108ea09.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30210","senseId":"1","lemma":"딸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다섯","meaning":"五","explanation":"다섯：五","readings":[{"term":"다섯","audio":"/audio/0d616c5afd4feb1394a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58111","senseId":"1","lemma":"다섯","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"명이라면서요?","meaning":"个，名","explanation":"명：个，名；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라면서요：引用名词判断或转述，再向对方确认。","readings":[{"term":"명","audio":"/audio/9f96b8e22cc06bfafc54.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70812","senseId":"1","lemma":"명","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8dc4d6918deb0b6e","term":"할머니","zh":"奶奶，姥姥","audio":"/audio/8dc4d6918deb0b6e1d10.mp3","entryId":"27375","definition":"用于指称或称呼父亲的母亲或母亲的母亲。","pronunciation":["할머니"]},{"id":"11cf51a3ca8b5108","term":"딸","zh":"女儿","audio":"/audio/11cf51a3ca8b5108ea09.mp3","entryId":"30210","definition":"由父母所生的子女中的女性；女性孩子。","pronunciation":["딸"]},{"id":"0d616c5afd4feb13","term":"다섯","zh":"五","audio":"/audio/0d616c5afd4feb1394a9.mp3","entryId":"58111","definition":"四加一后所得的数目。","pronunciation":["다섣"]},{"id":"9f96b8e22cc06bfa","term":"명","zh":"个，名","audio":"/audio/9f96b8e22cc06bfafc54.mp3","entryId":"70812","definition":"计算人数的数量单位。","pronunciation":["명"]}],"audio":"/audio/73839b6d8769b7e33d6d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n60624-1-8-2","ko":"네, 저 사람이 바로 우리 막내와 결혼한 다섯째 사위이지요.","zh":"是啊，那位就是娶了我小女儿的第五位女婿。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"저","meaning":"那","explanation":"저：那","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71214","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사람이","meaning":"人","explanation":"사람：人；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"1","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"바로","meaning":"正，就","explanation":"바로：正，就","readings":[{"term":"바로","audio":"/audio/a441b444c56119c0f154.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64744","senseId":"6","lemma":"바로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们","explanation":"우리：我们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"2","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"막내와","meaning":"老小","explanation":"막내：老小；와：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"막내","audio":"/audio/012b502c679d38daad59.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49941","senseId":"1","lemma":"막내","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"결혼한","meaning":"结婚","explanation":"결혼하다：结婚；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"결혼하다","audio":"/audio/8f40b8da9c69319343f7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17314","senseId":"1","lemma":"결혼하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다섯째","meaning":"第五，老五","explanation":"다섯째：第五，老五","readings":[{"term":"다섯째","audio":"/audio/0cfcc35fd58477bc1eaf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60624","senseId":"1","lemma":"다섯째","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사위이지요.","meaning":"女婿","explanation":"사위：女婿；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；지요：礼貌地确认、提醒或表达意愿；죠 是 지요 的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"사위","audio":"/audio/2a37c291aebc6a8002f7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61646","senseId":"1","lemma":"사위","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"那","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"71214","definition":"指代离说话人和听话人较远的对象。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"可以思考，会制造并使用语言和工具、构成社会而生活的存在。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"a441b444c56119c0","term":"바로","zh":"正，就","audio":"/audio/a441b444c56119c0f154.mp3","entryId":"64744","definition":"不是别的，正是。","pronunciation":["바로"]},{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己在内的一些人。一般对没有自己身份地位高的人使用。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"012b502c679d38da","term":"막내","zh":"老小","audio":"/audio/012b502c679d38daad59.mp3","entryId":"49941","definition":"在兄弟姐妹中最晚出生，年龄最小的人。","pronunciation":["망내"]},{"id":"8f40b8da9c693193","term":"결혼하다","zh":"结婚","audio":"/audio/8f40b8da9c69319343f7.mp3","entryId":"17314","definition":"男性和女性在法律上成为夫妻。","pronunciation":["결혼하다"]},{"id":"0cfcc35fd58477bc","term":"다섯째","zh":"第五，老五","audio":"/audio/0cfcc35fd58477bc1eaf.mp3","entryId":"60624","definition":"排在五的顺序的。","pronunciation":["다섣째"]},{"id":"2a37c291aebc6a80","term":"사위","zh":"女婿","audio":"/audio/2a37c291aebc6a8002f7.mp3","entryId":"61646","definition":"女儿的丈夫。","pronunciation":["사위"]}],"audio":"/audio/ae94ce1e096f9a142941.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.962,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=60624","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":59,"sequenceScore":2.